In Expresjs we can work with both API or SSR(with Template).
API:
It is a http interface to interact with our data.And the data is sent using json. In order to send back response we’re going to use res.json() method.
 

SSR(with Template):
In SSR, we will set up templates and send back entire html,css,javascript from server and we’re going to do that using res.render().
